{
  "slug": "designwithclaude",
  "name": "Designwithclaude",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "29 specialist design agents as slash commands. Expert guidance for visual\nhierarchy, accessibility, design systems, typography, color, motion, forms,\nnavigation, dashboards, mobile, responsive design, landing pages, dark mode, error handling, onboarding, data visualization, and more. Plus a master/design-brief command that routes natural language requests to the right specialist. No runtime, no dependencies — pure markdown skills that work instantly.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **41 commands**.\n\n- **Commands** (41): `accessibility-specialist` (WCAG compliance, ARIA, keyboard nav, screen readers), `auth-implementation` (Implement working login and signup using Clerk or Supabase Auth — actual code, not just design guidance), `auth-security-ux-specialist` (Login flows, password UX, 2FA/passkey, session management, permission prompts, trust signals), `b2b-saas-specialist` (Enterprise patterns, RBAC UI, multi-tenant, complex onboarding, admin dashboards), `brand-designer` (Visual identity, logo usage, brand colors, typography as brand expression), `checkout-specialist` (Cart UX, payment forms, guest checkout, trust signals, order confirmation), `code-explainer` (Paste any file or error — get a plain language explanation with no developer jargon), `color-specialist` (Color palettes, contrast, dark mode mapping, semantic colors, accessibility), and 33 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install designwithclaude@claude-community` from `imsaif/design-with-claude`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "command",
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "imsaif"
  },
  "externalUrl": "https://github.com/imsaif/design-with-claude/tree/d5af18663b706b0d26a3abc9c41ca1d6139b3b0d",
  "marketplace": "claude-community",
